"为了解有多少人在用、来自哪些国家或地区、在什么时段使用、哪些语法点最常被查，App 每天会匿名上报一条使用汇总：当天打开次数、按小时的使用分布、查看过的语法点及其等级、App Store 所在的国家或地区、界面语言和 App 版本。不包含姓名、账号、设备编号或任何能识别你的信息，通过 Apple 的 iCloud（CloudKit）保存，只用于改进 App。可以随时在「设置 → 匿名使用统计」中关闭。" = "To learn how many people use the app, which countries or regions they are in, when they use it and which grammar points are looked up most, the app sends one anonymous daily summary: how many times it was opened that day, usage by hour, the grammar points viewed and their levels, the App Store country or region, the interface language and the app version. It contains no name, account, device ID or anything that identifies you, is stored via Apple's iCloud (CloudKit) and is used only to improve the app. You can turn it off at any time in Settings → Anonymous Usage Statistics.";
